<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on the DAX index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on the DAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG said it has issued 140 million American-style call and put warrants, in 14 equal tranches, on the DAX index.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   17.FEB.97		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT, DUSSELDORF</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  3160 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
